        "en": "Ciocia, wujek, kuzyn"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Your mother's or father's sister is your *ciocia*, and their brother is your *wujek*. Their children are your *kuzyn* (a boy) and your *kuzynka* (a girl). Your wife's or husband's parents are your *teść* and *teściowa*, and your son's wife is your *synowa*. Two children born together are *bliźniaki*."
      }
